### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/

### List assignments
GET http://localhost:5000/api/assignments

### Create a valid submission (replace StudentCode and RepositoryUrl)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "dtc245200427",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dongtuan-creator/CNTTK23D"
}

### Invalid submission: empty student code should return 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dongtuan-creator/CNTTK23D"
}

### Read an existing submission (replace with an ID returned above)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Read a missing submission (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/submissions/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff

